{
    "title": "Wyze - Make Your Home Smarter",
    "description": "Wyze, based out of Seattle, WA, makes smart tech at super-accessible prices, trusted and backed by a community of over 5 million users just like you.\r\n\r\n\ud835\udde7\ud835\uddf5\ud835\uddf6\ud835\ude00 \ud835\uddf6\ud835\ude00 \ud835\ude04\ud835\uddf5\ud835\uddf2\ud835\uddff\ud835\uddf2 \ud835\uddf6\ud835\ude01 \ud835\uddee\ud835\uddf9\ud835\uddf9 \ud835\uddf9\ud835\uddf6\ud835\ude03\ud835\uddf2\ud835\ude00.\r\nShop, set up, view, and interact. Craft the ideal smart home for you and your family, and then control your smart devices from our ecosystem of affordable high-quality tech \u2013 all tied together in an app that won\u2019t stress you out.\r\n\r\n\ud835\udde7\ud835\uddf5\ud835\uddf2 \ud835\uddf0\ud835\uddee\ud835\uddfa\ud835\ude00 \ud835\ude01\ud835\uddf5\ud835\uddee\ud835\ude01 \ud835\ude00\ud835\ude01\ud835\uddee\ud835\uddff\ud835\ude01\ud835\uddf2\ud835\uddf1 \ud835\uddf6\ud835\ude01 \ud835\uddee\ud835\uddf9\ud835\uddf9.\r\nOur first product was the trendsetting Wyze Cam: a multi-purpose indoor smart camera that helped our users keep an eye on what matters most without a hefty price tag. Now, Wyze has a full lineup of wired and wireless smart cameras fit for any occasion - whether that\u2019s to serve as a baby monitor, capture proof of the pests in the garden, watch over your loved ones (including pets!), and nearly everything else. Wyze Cams are even more powerful when enhanced with our optional Cam Plus subscription.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Wyze Cam Outdoor\r\n\u2022 Wyze Video Doorbell\r\n\u2022 Wyze Cam Pan\r\n\u2022 Wyze Cam v3\r\n\r\n\ud835\udde6\ud835\uddee\ud835\uddf3\ud835\uddf2\ud835\ude01\ud835\ude06 \ud835\ude00\ud835\uddf5\ud835\uddfc\ud835\ude02\ud835\uddf9\ud835\uddf1\ud835\uddfb'\ud835\ude01 \ud835\uddef\ud835\uddff\ud835\uddf2\ud835\uddee\ud835\uddf8 \ud835\ude01\ud835\uddf5\ud835\uddf2 \ud835\uddef\ud835\uddee\ud835\uddfb\ud835\uddf8.\r\nKeep an eye on your family and possessions with the award-winning Wyze Home Monitoring subscription, powered by our friends at Noonlight. It\u2019s smart, straightforward, and ultra-affordable - that\u2019s home security the Wyze way. For those that prefer to keep tabs on their home themselves, you can use motion and open detection from Wyze Sense alongside Wyze Cam detection notifications for self-monitoring instead.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Wyze Home Monitoring Service\r\n\u2022 Wyze Motion Sensors\r\n\u2022 Wyze Entry Sensors\r\n\r\n\ud835\uddd6\ud835\uddfc\ud835\uddfb\ud835\ude03\ud835\uddf2\ud835\uddfb\ud835\uddf6\ud835\uddf2\ud835\uddfb\ud835\uddf0\ud835\uddf2 \ud835\uddf3\ud835\uddff\ud835\uddfc\ud835\uddfa \ud835\ude01\ud835\uddf5\ud835\uddf2 \ud835\uddf0\ud835\uddfc\ud835\uddfa\ud835\uddf3\ud835\uddfc\ud835\uddff\ud835\ude01 \ud835\uddfc\ud835\uddf3 \ud835\ude06\ud835\uddfc\ud835\ude02\ud835\uddff \ud835\uddf0\ud835\uddfc\ud835\ude02\ud835\uddf0\ud835\uddf5.\r\nSwitch up your ambiance with our line of top-rated dimmable smart bulbs including Wyze Bulb Color and its impressive 16-million color range. Don\u2019t want to swap out your bulbs? \r\n\r\n\u2022 Wyze Bulb /Color\r\n\u2022 Wyze Plug /Outdoor\r\n\r\n\ud835\udde6\ud835\uddfd\ud835\uddf2\ud835\uddfb\ud835\uddf1 \ud835\uddfa\ud835\uddfc\ud835\uddff\ud835\uddf2 \ud835\ude01\ud835\uddf6\ud835\uddfa\ud835\uddf2 \ud835\uddf1\ud835\uddfc\ud835\uddf6\ud835\uddfb\ud835\uddf4 \ud835\ude04\ud835\uddf5\ud835\uddee\ud835\ude01 \ud835\ude06\ud835\uddfc\ud835\ude02 \ud835\uddf9\ud835\uddfc\ud835\ude03\ud835\uddf2.\r\nAuto-unlock your front door when you get home, auto-water the garden, auto-adjust the temperature, auto-vacuum the floors, and more. Reserve your home time for relaxation and fun instead of routine chores using our lineup of friendly smart home devices.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Wyze Lock\r\n\u2022 Wyze Thermostat\r\n\u2022 Wyze Sprinkler Controller\r\n\u2022 Wyze Robot Vacuum\r\n\r\n\ud835\uddd4 \ud835\ude04\ud835\uddf6\ud835\uddfb\ud835\uddf1\ud835\uddfc\ud835\ude04 \ud835\ude01\ud835\uddfc \ud835\uddee \ud835\uddf5\ud835\uddf2\ud835\uddee\ud835\uddf9\ud835\ude01\ud835\uddf5\ud835\uddf6\ud835\uddf2\ud835\uddff, \ud835\uddf5\ud835\uddee\ud835\uddfd\ud835\uddfd\ud835\uddf6\ud835\uddf2\ud835\uddff \ud835\ude06\ud835\uddfc\ud835\ude02.\r\nOur Health and Lifestyle products are designed to enhance your wellness journey and keep you connected. With our range of smartwatches, you can easily track your health metrics, stay updated with SMS and call notifications, and enjoy your favorite music on the go. Our smart scales provide detailed insights into your fitness progress, while our earbuds and headphones offer premium sound quality for an immersive audio experience. Each smartwatch is equipped with SMS/Call Log functionality, allowing you to see who is calling or texting directly on your wrist. Our products are committed to keeping you informed and focused on living your best life.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Wyze Watch 44mm\r\n\u2022 Wyze Watch 47mm\r\n\u2022 Wyze Scale\r\n\u2022 Wyze Band\r\n\u2022 Wyze Buds Pro\r\n\u2022 Wyze Buds\r\n\u2022 Wyze Noise-Cancelling Headphones\r\n\r\n\ud835\udde3\ud835\uddf9\ud835\uddee\ud835\ude06\ud835\ude00 \ud835\ude04\ud835\uddf2\ud835\uddf9\ud835\uddf9 \ud835\ude04\ud835\uddf6\ud835\ude01\ud835\uddf5 \ud835\uddfc\ud835\ude01\ud835\uddf5\ud835\uddf2\ud835\uddff\ud835\ude00.\r\nYour Wyze devices get even more powerful when they\u2019re linked up with our integration partners. Whether you\u2019re an Amazon Alexa user with an Echo at home, a Google Assistant user with a Google Home, or a DIY-er that likes to experiment with IFTTT, Wyze supports it all. \r\n\r\nManaging Your Account:\r\n\r\nYour privacy and control over your data are important to us. If you wish to delete your account, you can easily do so directly within the app. Please follow these simple steps:\r\n\r\n- Account Tab -> Account ->  Delete account \r\n- Tap the 3 checkboxes then tap Delete.\r\n- Enter your Wyze account password again and tap Delete.\r\nUpon deleting your account, all your data will be permanently removed from our servers, and you will not be able to recover any data associated with your account.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Wyze, based out of Seattle, WA, makes smart tech at super-accessible prices, trusted and backed by a community of over 5 million users just like you.<br><br>\ud835\udde7\ud835\uddf5\ud835\uddf6\ud835\ude00 \ud835\uddf6\ud835\ude00 \ud835\ude04\ud835\uddf5\ud835\uddf2\ud835\uddff\ud835\uddf2 \ud835\uddf6\ud835\ude01 \ud835\uddee\ud835\uddf9\ud835\uddf9 \ud835\uddf9\ud835\uddf6\ud835\ude03\ud835\uddf2\ud835\ude00.<br>Shop, set up, view, and interact. Craft the ideal smart home for you and your family, and then control your smart devices from our ecosystem of affordable high-quality tech \u2013 all tied together in an app that won\u2019t stress you out.<br><br>\ud835\udde7\ud835\uddf5\ud835\uddf2 \ud835\uddf0\ud835\uddee\ud835\uddfa\ud835\ude00 \ud835\ude01\ud835\uddf5\ud835\uddee\ud835\ude01 \ud835\ude00\ud835\ude01\ud835\uddee\ud835\uddff\ud835\ude01\ud835\uddf2\ud835\uddf1 \ud835\uddf6\ud835\ude01 \ud835\uddee\ud835\uddf9\ud835\uddf9.<br>Our first product was the trendsetting Wyze Cam: a multi-purpose indoor smart camera that helped our users keep an eye on what matters most without a hefty price tag. Now, Wyze has a full lineup of wired and wireless smart cameras fit for any occasion - whether that\u2019s to serve as a baby monitor, capture proof of the pests in the garden, watch over your loved ones (including pets!), and nearly everything else. Wyze Cams are even more powerful when enhanced with our optional Cam Plus subscription.<br><br>\u2022 Wyze Cam Outdoor<br>\u2022 Wyze Video Doorbell<br>\u2022 Wyze Cam Pan<br>\u2022 Wyze Cam v3<br><br>\ud835\udde6\ud835\uddee\ud835\uddf3\ud835\uddf2\ud835\ude01\ud835\ude06 \ud835\ude00\ud835\uddf5\ud835\uddfc\ud835\ude02\ud835\uddf9\ud835\uddf1\ud835\uddfb&#39;\ud835\ude01 \ud835\uddef\ud835\uddff\ud835\uddf2\ud835\uddee\ud835\uddf8 \ud835\ude01\ud835\uddf5\ud835\uddf2 \ud835\uddef\ud835\uddee\ud835\uddfb\ud835\uddf8.<br>Keep an eye on your family and possessions with the award-winning Wyze Home Monitoring subscription, powered by our friends at Noonlight. It\u2019s smart, straightforward, and ultra-affordable - that\u2019s home security the Wyze way. For those that prefer to keep tabs on their home themselves, you can use motion and open detection from Wyze Sense alongside Wyze Cam detection notifications for self-monitoring instead.<br><br>\u2022 Wyze Home Monitoring Service<br>\u2022 Wyze Motion Sensors<br>\u2022 Wyze Entry Sensors<br><br>\ud835\uddd6\ud835\uddfc\ud835\uddfb\ud835\ude03\ud835\uddf2\ud835\uddfb\ud835\uddf6\ud835\uddf2\ud835\uddfb\ud835\uddf0\ud835\uddf2 \ud835\uddf3\ud835\uddff\ud835\uddfc\ud835\uddfa \ud835\ude01\ud835\uddf5\ud835\uddf2 \ud835\uddf0\ud835\uddfc\ud835\uddfa\ud835\uddf3\ud835\uddfc\ud835\uddff\ud835\ude01 \ud835\uddfc\ud835\uddf3 \ud835\ude06\ud835\uddfc\ud835\ude02\ud835\uddff \ud835\uddf0\ud835\uddfc\ud835\ude02\ud835\uddf0\ud835\uddf5.<br>Switch up your ambiance with our line of top-rated dimmable smart bulbs including Wyze Bulb Color and its impressive 16-million color range. Don\u2019t want to swap out your bulbs? <br><br>\u2022 Wyze Bulb /Color<br>\u2022 Wyze Plug /Outdoor<br><br>\ud835\udde6\ud835\uddfd\ud835\uddf2\ud835\uddfb\ud835\uddf1 \ud835\uddfa\ud835\uddfc\ud835\uddff\ud835\uddf2 \ud835\ude01\ud835\uddf6\ud835\uddfa\ud835\uddf2 \ud835\uddf1\ud835\uddfc\ud835\uddf6\ud835\uddfb\ud835\uddf4 \ud835\ude04\ud835\uddf5\ud835\uddee\ud835\ude01 \ud835\ude06\ud835\uddfc\ud835\ude02 \ud835\uddf9\ud835\uddfc\ud835\ude03\ud835\uddf2.<br>Auto-unlock your front door when you get home, auto-water the garden, auto-adjust the temperature, auto-vacuum the floors, and more. Reserve your home time for relaxation and fun instead of routine chores using our lineup of friendly smart home devices.<br><br>\u2022 Wyze Lock<br>\u2022 Wyze Thermostat<br>\u2022 Wyze Sprinkler Controller<br>\u2022 Wyze Robot Vacuum<br><br>\ud835\uddd4 \ud835\ude04\ud835\uddf6\ud835\uddfb\ud835\uddf1\ud835\uddfc\ud835\ude04 \ud835\ude01\ud835\uddfc \ud835\uddee \ud835\uddf5\ud835\uddf2\ud835\uddee\ud835\uddf9\ud835\ude01\ud835\uddf5\ud835\uddf6\ud835\uddf2\ud835\uddff, \ud835\uddf5\ud835\uddee\ud835\uddfd\ud835\uddfd\ud835\uddf6\ud835\uddf2\ud835\uddff \ud835\ude06\ud835\uddfc\ud835\ude02.<br>Our Health and Lifestyle products are designed to enhance your wellness journey and keep you connected. With our range of smartwatches, you can easily track your health metrics, stay updated with SMS and call notifications, and enjoy your favorite music on the go. Our smart scales provide detailed insights into your fitness progress, while our earbuds and headphones offer premium sound quality for an immersive audio experience. Each smartwatch is equipped with SMS/Call Log functionality, allowing you to see who is calling or texting directly on your wrist. Our products are committed to keeping you informed and focused on living your best life.<br><br>\u2022 Wyze Watch 44mm<br>\u2022 Wyze Watch 47mm<br>\u2022 Wyze Scale<br>\u2022 Wyze Band<br>\u2022 Wyze Buds Pro<br>\u2022 Wyze Buds<br>\u2022 Wyze Noise-Cancelling Headphones<br><br>\ud835\udde3\ud835\uddf9\ud835\uddee\ud835\ude06\ud835\ude00 \ud835\ude04\ud835\uddf2\ud835\uddf9\ud835\uddf9 \ud835\ude04\ud835\uddf6\ud835\ude01\ud835\uddf5 \ud835\uddfc\ud835\ude01\ud835\uddf5\ud835\uddf2\ud835\uddff\ud835\ude00.<br>Your Wyze devices get even more powerful when they\u2019re linked up with our integration partners. Whether you\u2019re an Amazon Alexa user with an Echo at home, a Google Assistant user with a Google Home, or a DIY-er that likes to experiment with IFTTT, Wyze supports it all. <br><br>Managing Your Account:<br><br>Your privacy and control over your data are important to us. If you wish to delete your account, you can easily do so directly within the app. Please follow these simple steps:<br><br>- Account Tab -&gt; Account -&gt;  Delete account <br>- Tap the 3 checkboxes then tap Delete.<br>- Enter your Wyze account password again and tap Delete.<br>Upon deleting your account, all your data will be permanently removed from our servers, and you will not be able to recover any data associated with your account.",
